WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.306
Today we will shape a useful object from malleable material. Our work connects with

00:00:05.306 --> 00:00:07.859
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.983
Roll a smooth ball of soft material.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:16.540
Press a thumb gently into the centre and pinch the sides evenly.

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:22.471
Smooth the rim and show how the finished bowl can stand. Justify a revision using

00:00:22.471 --> 00:00:24.172
evidence from another world tradition.
